==Tailoring==
Slime is used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create a [[File:Shirt096.png|24px]] [[Tailoring|Shirt]].

==Quests==
*20 Slime are requested by [[Slimejack]] in a [[Fish Pond#Quests|Fish Pond quest]] to increase the capacity of the pond from 1 to 3.
*5 Slime may be requested by [[Bullhead]] or [[Largemouth Bass]] in a [[Fish Pond#Quests|Fish Pond quest]] to increase the capacity of the pond from 3 to 5.
*99 Slime may be requested by the Raccoon at the [[Giant Stump]] as part of his fifth request, or as part of any request starting with the sixth.

